{
  "name": "Candy Box!",
  "description": "A box sealed inside a wrapped candy with 3 HP. You cannot tap it at all — picking up the boxes next to it tears the wrapper, cracks the candy, then shatters it. The colour inside stays hidden until the very last hit.",
